---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Early access and pricing" description="BarkHaus is in active development. Talk with us about early access and pricing for your rescue.">
  <Navbar currentPage="/pricing" />
  <main><section class="bh-page"><div class="bh-container"><p class="bh-overline">EARLY ACCESS</p><h1>Let's find the right fit for your rescue.</h1><p class="bh-lead">We're working directly with early rescue partners while BarkHaus takes shape. Tell us about your organization, your current tools, and the workflow you want to improve.</p><a class="bh-button bh-button-primary" href="/contact">Ask about early access ↗</a></div></section>
  <section class="bh-content"><div class="bh-container" style="max-width:850px"><p class="bh-overline">PRICING</p><h2>Clear details before you commit.</h2><p style="line-height:1.9;color:#665d56">We are reviewing plan structure and pricing as we develop the product. Contact us for the current early access options and an honest walkthrough of what is available for your rescue today.</p><p class="bh-note">Previous drafts of this site listed different plan prices, trial terms, discounts, and results. Those figures have not been verified as a current offer, so they are not shown here.</p></div></section></main><Footer />
</BaseLayout>
